{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"abf7e49f53846c50a564669c5385b195d4e2595a26fa303dc641126efadbf9a6","digest":{"component_or_area":"MCP tracker store / push recovery","key_entities":["src/rebar/_store/push.py","src/rebar/_store/push_classify.py","src/rebar/_store/push_recovery.py","src/rebar/_store/freshness.py","src/rebar/llm/overlap/queue.py","origin/tickets","tickets branch","rebar-push-pending marker",".env-id","MCP_TICKETS_PAT","overlap_drain config","_cas_backoff","llm/plan_review/attest_gate.claim_gate_check","_commands/gates.close_plan_review_gate_check","_commands/close_precheck._completion_precheck"],"problem_keywords":["tracker writes stranded","push failure","git merge recovery","store staleness","write path degradation","concurrent pushes","race condition","silent data loss"],"propositions":["MCP tracker writes (comments, edits, set_file_impact, links, transitions) commit locally but cannot push to origin/tickets; every write returns success but is never visible to other readers or the gates","The deployed container's tickets store accumulates unpushed commits (observed 84 ahead, 150 merge commits for 28 real events) because fetch->merge->push recovery (2.4-4.2s) loses a structural race against competing pushes from the enrichment pipeline (every 2-4s)","Gate READ paths must refuse certification when the store is provably stale (behind/diverged from already-fetched remote-tracking ref, or rebar-push-pending marker present), reporting stale-store and the local-CLI fallback, rather than certify against a diverged view","AC2's gate-level freshness assertion (claim_gate_check, close_plan_review_gate_check, _completion_precheck) shipped as commit 59093c891328 and now refuses stale stores locally without network dependency or raising exceptions","The deployed store now converges to zero unpushed commits after mitigation (overlap_drain turned off) and live validation confirms MCP writes reach origin/tickets observable by independent readers","ENV_ID_MISMATCH on the store is accepted as a labeling artifact with no attestation consequence (zero SIGNATURE events under the mismatched env ids on origin/tickets)"]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787960912353097779,"uuid":"b4450219-9805-418e-ad5b-973cbb164bb9"}